#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:224
msgid "5.1 Single-Node Online Deployment"
msgstr "5.1 单节点在线部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:226
msgid ""
"Single-node deployment completes both Prefill and Decode within the same "
"node, suitable for development, testing, and small-to-medium scale inference"
" scenarios. For the Qwen3-30B-A3B MoE model, Expert Parallelism (EP) is "
"required to distribute experts across NPUs."
msgstr ""
"单节点部署在同一节点内完成 Prefill 和 Decode，适用于开发、测试以及中小规模推理场景。对于 Qwen3-30B-A3B MoE "
"模型，需要专家并行（EP）来将专家分布到多个 NPU 上。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:228
msgid ""
"The following command is an example configuration. Adjust the parameters "
"based on your actual scenario."
msgstr "以下命令是一个示例配置。请根据您的实际场景调整参数。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md
msgid "Atlas A2 inference products / Atlas A3 inference products"
msgstr "Atlas A2 推理产品 / Atlas A3 推理产品"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:283
msgid "Key parameters:"
msgstr "关键参数："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:285
msgid ""
"`--tensor-parallel-size 2` maps the model across two Atlas inference "
"devices. Adjust it together with `ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES` according to "
"the available devices and memory."
msgstr ""
"`--tensor-parallel-size 2` 将模型映射到两个 Atlas 推理设备上。根据可用设备和内存，与 "
"`ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES` 一起调整。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:286
msgid ""
"`--dtype float16` is used for Atlas inference products to match the Atlas "
"inference execution path."
msgstr "`--dtype float16` 用于 Atlas 推理产品，以匹配 Atlas 推理执行路径。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:287
msgid ""
"`--max-model-len 16384` is intentionally conservative. On Atlas inference "
"products, large context lengths allocate large attention masks, so do not "
"rely on automatic max-model-len detection."
msgstr ""
"`--max-model-len 16384` 有意设置得较为保守。在 Atlas 推理产品上，大的上下文长度会分配大的注意力掩码，因此不要依赖自动的 "
"max-model-len 检测。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:288
msgid ""
"`--max-num-seqs 16` limits concurrent active requests to reduce KV cache and"
" graph capture pressure on Atlas inference products."
msgstr "`--max-num-seqs 16` 限制并发活动请求，以减少 Atlas 推理产品上的 KV 缓存和图捕获压力。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:289
msgid ""
"`--gpu-memory-utilization` controls KV cache capacity. Reduce it if startup "
"or runtime requests report OOM."
msgstr "`--gpu-memory-utilization` 控制 KV 缓存容量。如果启动或运行时请求报告 OOM，请减小该值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:290
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--additional-config '{\"ascend_compilation_config\": {\"fuse_norm_quant\": "
"false}}'` disables norm-quant fusion for the Atlas inference products "
"serving path."
msgstr ""
"`--additional-config '{\"ascend_compilation_config\": {\"fuse_norm_quant\": "
"false}}'` 为Atlas推理产品服务路径禁用norm-quant融合。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:291
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\", "
"\"cudagraph_capture_sizes\": [1,32]}'` enables decode ACLGraph replay and "
"explicitly limits capture sizes for Atlas inference products."
msgstr ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\", "
"\"cudagraph_capture_sizes\": [1,32]}'` 为Atlas推理产品启用解码ACLGraph重放并显式限制捕获大小。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:292
msgid ""
"`--no-enable-prefix-caching` is the default recommendation for this Atlas "
"inference products example to reduce memory pressure."
msgstr "`--no-enable-prefix-caching` 是该Atlas推理产品示例的默认推荐设置，用于降低内存压力。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:293
msgid ""
"`--quantization ascend` enables Ascend quantization for the W8A8 model. "
"Remove this option when deploying the BF16 model."
msgstr "`--quantization ascend` 为W8A8模型启用昇腾量化。部署BF16模型时请移除该选项。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:297
msgid ""
"`ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES`: must be set to the NPU chip IDs allocated to "
"your environment (e.g., `0,1,2,3` for 4 chips)."
msgstr "`ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES`：必须设置为分配给环境的NPU芯片ID（例如，4芯片时设为`0,1,2,3`）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:298
msgid ""
"`--port`: adjust to avoid conflicts with other services running on the same "
"machine."
msgstr "`--port`：调整端口以避免与同一机器上运行的其他服务冲突。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:299
msgid ""
"`--no-enable-prefix-caching`: disabled by default as prefix caching "
"effectiveness for this model on Ascend NPUs has not been fully "
"characterized. You can try enabling it to evaluate the cache hit rate for "
"your workload."
msgstr ""
"`--no-enable-prefix-"
"caching`：默认禁用，因为该模型在昇腾NPU上的前缀缓存效果尚未完全评估。您可以尝试启用它以评估工作负载的缓存命中率。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:300
msgid ""
"`--quantization ascend`: required for W8A8 quantized models. Remove this "
"parameter when using BF16 weights."
msgstr "`--quantization ascend`：W8A8量化模型必需。使用BF16权重时请移除该参数。"

