#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:416
msgid "8 Performance Evaluation"
msgstr "8性能评估"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:420
msgid ""
"For setup details, please refer to [Using AISBench for performance "
"evaluation](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md#execute-"
"performance-evaluation)."
msgstr ""
"有关设置详情，请参考[使用AISBench进行性能评估](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md#execute-"
"performance-evaluation)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:422
msgid ""
"First, configure the model for streaming performance testing "
"(`ais_bench/benchmark/configs/models/vllm_api/vllm_api_stream_chat.py`):"
msgstr ""
"首先，配置用于流式性能测试的模型（`ais_bench/benchmark/configs/models/vllm_api/vllm_api_stream_chat.py`）："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:452
msgid ""
"Key differences from the accuracy config: `stream=True`, `ignore_eos=True` "
"(ensures output reaches `max_out_len` for consistent TPOT measurement), and "
"`batch_size` controls concurrency."
msgstr ""
"与精度配置的关键区别：`stream=True`、`ignore_eos=True`（确保输出达到`max_out_len`以进行一致的TPOT测量），以及`batch_size`控制并发数。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:454
msgid ""
"Then, configure the synthetic dataset distribution "
"(`ais_bench/datasets/synthetic/synthetic_config.py`). Adjust the "
"configuration based on your actual scenario. Note that random synthetic data"
" is not suitable for benchmarking scenarios where prefix caching is enabled,"
" as random inputs produce zero cache hit rate."
msgstr ""
"然后，配置合成数据集分布（`ais_bench/datasets/synthetic/synthetic_config.py`）。根据实际场景调整配置。请注意，随机合成数据不适用于启用前缀缓存的基准测试场景，因为随机输入会产生零缓存命中率。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:473
msgid "Then run the performance evaluation:"
msgstr "然后运行性能评估："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:479
msgid ""
"The `--models` value should match the `abbr` in your model config file. Use "
"`--num-prompts` to limit the number of test requests."
msgstr "`--models`值应与模型配置文件中的`abbr`匹配。使用`--num-prompts`限制测试请求数量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:481
msgid "Using vLLM Benchmark"
msgstr "使用vLLM基准测试"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:483
msgid ""
"Refer to [vLLM benchmark](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/benchmarking/) for "
"more details."
msgstr "更多详情请参考[vLLM基准测试](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/benchmarking/)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-30B-A3B.md:485
msgid ""
"Take the `serve` subcommand as an example. The `--random-output-len` "
"parameter controls the number of output tokens per request; adjust it based "
"on your target scenario (e.g., 2048 for short outputs, 32768 for long "
"outputs)."
msgstr ""
"以`serve`子命令为例。`--random-output-"
"len`参数控制每个请求的输出token数量；根据目标场景进行调整（例如，短输出为2048，长输出为32768）。"

